    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Find the LinkedIn company page for '{{ $('Get Vendor Record').first().json.company_name }}' (website: {{ $('Get Vendor Record').first().json.website }}).\n\nUse the search tool. Try this query:\n\"{{ $('Get Vendor Record').first().json.company_name }}\" site:linkedin.com/company\n\nFrom the search results:\n1. Find the LinkedIn company page URL (format: https://www.linkedin.com/company/SLUG/)\n2. Extract the follower count from the search snippet (e.g., \"1,234 followers on LinkedIn\")\n\nIf the company already has a known LinkedIn URL: {{ $('Get Vendor Record').first().json.linkedin_url || 'none' }}\n— still search to get the current follower count.\n\nReturn null for linkedin_url if you cannot find the company page with confidence.\nReturn null for linkedin_followers if the follower count is not visible in the search results.",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "options": {}
